--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave power cable with discrete buoyancy modules, deck mesh too coarse at touchdown
-- The cable of lazy_wave_touchdown_planar_coarse.dat with its 100 m buoyant stretch built from the
-- bare cable plus 25 discrete buoyancy modules at a 4 m pitch, one on each node from 80 m to 176 m
-- (each carries the extra mass and displaced volume of 4 m of the buoy section). Its static solve
-- runs in the vertical plane of the line and ends with the attachment polish. On the coarse deck
-- mesh (10 m elements along the grounded run) the discrete planar state is unstable out of its
-- plane: the driver names it in a note, once, after the polish, and solves the deck unchanged.
